  "game:characterdesc-insectoid-hunter": "<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>Faster and more aggressive, these creatures have adapted their bodies to take down prey more efficiently..</i></font>",
  "game:characterdesc-insectoid-scavenger": "<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>Generally a more nomadic and solitary type, this type of insectoid is adapted for survival in harsher environments.</i></font>",  
  "game:characterdesc-insectoid-guard": "<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>Soldiers, Guards, and often hard-working and sturdy insectoids, they're made for defending their Queen against the enemies.</i></font>",  
  "game:characterdesc-insectoid-tinkerer": "<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>The craftier of insectoids, specialized in mechanicals and advanced weaponry to make up for any colony weaknesses.</i></font>",  
  "game:characterdesc-insectoid-weaver": "<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>A uniquely developed insectoid, specialized in textiles and mending. Often work great as healers in the colony as well.</i></font>",  
  "game:characterdesc-insectoid-digger": "<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>Said to be part of the originating colony, spending their days buried beneath stone and soil.</i></font>",  

